{
 "endpoint": "/embeddings",
 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What did reporting depend on before it switched to the event-bus?\n[2025-09-19] standup/boreal/2025-09-19: We decided that reporting will read from the event-bus instead of querying the ledger directly. The reason: the nightly ledger scans were blocking billing runs. That removes the dependency on Ledger from the reporting service. [2025-11-13] standup/boreal/2025-11-13: The reporting service still relies on the bus; keep that in mind for the maintenance. [2025-02-13] standup/boreal/2025-02-13: The notifier calls the event-bus for delivery events, so treat the event-bus as a hard dependency of the notifier. Dependency map update: webhooks needs the event-bus (outbound events).",
  "dimensions": 1536
 },
